🚀 Emerging Healthcare Trends Fueling Market Growth
Momentum in personalized medicine, next-generation sequencing (NGS), and biomarker-driven clinical decision-making is reshaping oncology diagnostics. Digital pathology, liquid biopsy expansion, and AI-assisted interpretation are accelerating test adoption, improving turnaround times, and enabling more precise oncology treatment strategies.
The increasing prioritization of early cancer detection and treatment matching aligns with global health priorities, with cancer continuing to be a leading cause of mortality worldwide (source: WHO)—a reality pushing demand for advanced diagnostic frameworks and scalable precision tools.

